    BRANCH
        IF `the facts`'s `knows or suspects that another person has committed or attempted to commit an offence under any of sections 15 to 18`
           OR `the facts`'s `has reasonable grounds for knowing or suspecting that another person has committed or attempted to commit such an offence`
            THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The first condition is that he—"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

