           OR (`the exceptions`'s `a professional legal adviser or relevant professional adviser` AND `the exceptions`'s `the information or other matter came to him in privileged circumstances`)
           OR `s 21A(5A) subsection (5A) applies to the person` `the assistance` EQUALS JUST TRUE
